SUMMARY:Modern Magic Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Live music at The Melon Ball in Davis. \nExperience an unforgettable evening of mystery\, laughter\, and seemingly impossible thrills as Modern Magic Live! brings together three contemporary magicians for one spectacular event. \nThe evening begins with intimate strolling magic then continues with a fast-paced stage show where award-winning professional magicians Craig Meyers\, Roman Spinale\, and Michael Nguyen each bring a distinct style to create astonishing sleights of hand\, mind-reading\, and visual illusions
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/modern-magic-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Magic080826_Banner-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
