SUMMARY:Worldwide Bingo Night: Landmarks Edition
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Davis for a globally inspired twist on bingo! Worldwide Bingo Night: Landmarks Edition invites you to explore landmarks from around the world. \nParticipants will play multiple rounds of bingo using landmark-themed cards\, learn interesting cultural and historical facts\, and have the chance to win prizes! This event is designed for all\, whether you love to travel or simply want to learn more about the world! This event is for ages 18+\, with complimentary snacks and beverages available.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/worldwide-bingo-night-landmarks-edition/
LOCATION:International House Davis\, 10 College Park\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="International House Davis":MAILTO:shahzana@ihousedavis.org
END:VEVENT
